// Title: Potential WMI Lateral Movement WmiPrvSE Spawned PowerShell
// Rule ID: 692f0bec-83ba-4d04-af7e-e884a96059b6
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.execution, attack.t1047, attack.t1059.001
// Category: process_creation
